hymns.content:
Ekidd:
Nze Musumba, Nze Musumba, 
Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala,
Nze Musumba. x2

1(a) 
Nze nzimanyi;
Nze Musumba.

Endiga zange;
Nze Musumba.

Nazo zimmanyi nze;
Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala, Nze Musumba

(b) 
Nze nziyita;
Nze Musumba.

Endiga zange;
Nze Musumba.

Nazo zimmanyi nze;
Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala, Nze Musumba

(c) 
Okuziyamba;
Nze Musumba

Lye ssanyu lyange;
Nze Musumba.

Zonna ne nzikuuma;
Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala, Nze Musumba

(d) 
Okubulwa emu;
Nze Musumba.

Kwe kunyolwa ennyo;
Nze Musumba.

Zonna nzagala nze;
Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala, Nze Musumba

2. Mpaayo obulamu bwange okubeera abantu
Nzuuno kale, bonna mbagala. x2

(a) 
Ssirundira mpeera bantu bange;  

Tukwaniriza Ggwe Musumba, 
Yezu Kabaka ow’Obuyinza tukulembere.

(b) 
Ssirudira mpeera muje mwenna;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Ssibasosola abajja mujje mwenna;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Sibalira mpaayo obulamu bwange;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

N’obwesige nnunda buli ajja yenna;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Siyabulira n’omu ampita nze;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Nnabalokola sijja kubasuula;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Ndibatumira najja Mwoyo wange;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Mulyebaza wamma mu ssanyu eyo;
Tukwaniriza Ggwe....

Nze Musumba, Nze Musumba, Nze Musumba Omulungi abagala, Nze Musumba. x2

1. Tuzze gy’oli be watonda;
Ggwe.
Tuzze tuutuno, Katonda;
Omutonzi omwagalwa.
Tuzze gy’oli tukusinze;
Oh! Ow’amaanyi ow’obuyinza,
Osaana kwagalwa x2

Ekidd:
Tumukubire enngoma gwe twaniriza
Omukama Nnyinimu
Tumuyimbire ne mu nnyimba
Afuga eggulu n’ensi ow’ettendo
Wuuno amazima! Ali mu nnyumba ye. x2

2. Twesiimye ffe mu kifo kyo;
Ggwe.
Tweyanze wano we tuzze;
Omutonzi omwagalwa.
Wamma enju yo ya kitiibwa;
Oh! Ow’amaanyi ow’obuyinza, 
Osaana kwagalwa x2

Ekidd: 
Azuukidde, tali muno
Yezu Kabaka agenze nno, tali muno!
E Galilaya gye mulimusanga,
E Galilaya gye mulimusanga.

1. Abakedde eyo gy’ebaamuziika
Basanzeyo Malayika n’abagamba;
//‘‘Takyaali mu ntaana Yezu Kabaka,
Takyaali mu ntaana.’’//

2. Mwe eddembe eryange libaddeko mmwe
Eddembe eryange lye lya Kitange!
//‘Nzuuno ddala mulabe abaana,
Sikyali mu ntaana.’//

3. Abaana be abatume aboolesa ebyo
Mu mbiriizi n’ebibatu nalaga ebyo;
//Bakakasa mazima Yezu Kabaka
Wuuno ddala omuzira//

4. Atwagala Yezu Kabaka abaana be ffe
Awaddeyo obulamu olw’okuba ffe;
//Ggwe Musumba omuzira olwanye,
Ssebo tusiimye nnyo//

5. Luwangula omugabe ow’ekitiibwa,
Olwanye nnyo olutalo n’ogoba olwo
//Ssemigero omuzira olwanye,
Ggwe muzira asinga//.

6. Otuggyeeko ekinene eky’akabi ffe
Ffe abaana bo tufuge tuli naawe
//Naffe tuli mu liryo eggye eryo
Tuwondera Omuzira//.
